# The Dockerfiles build with the repo root as the context, so Docker reads this file and not frontend/.dockerignore.
# Keep local installs, build output, and test output out of the images. A host node_modules has binaries for the host OS.
.git
artifacts
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
# The frontend.esproj build on macOS makes a folder with a literal backslash in its name.
**/obj\\*
**/dist
**/TestResults
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vitest
